{"branch":"진천점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"진천점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">진천점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39t4qrxq92z.htm\" title=\"진천점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>대구광역시 달서구 조암남로 158,301호(유천동)</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 지하철</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-line\">대구 1호선</span>진천역</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>월배쌍용예가앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>월배쌍용예가건너</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>진천역AK그랑폴리스아파트앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>월배아이파크1차앞</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0101\">간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>501</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0102\">지선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>달서1</span><span>성서2(대천-강정-기곡(육신사,도채)-강정-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-강정-육신사-강정-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-기곡(대평,상당,터실)-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-기곡(육신사,도채)-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-대평-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-문산-하산스무지-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-하산스무지(대구보훈요양원)-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-하산스무지(육신사)-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-하산스무지-대천)</span><span>성서2(대천-하산스무지-문산-대천)</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}